          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On February 22, 1980, while reading the weekly magazine \"SPECIAL DERNIERE\" No. 572 from February 15 to 21, 1980, gendarmes learned that the husband of a restaurant owner had allegedly been abducted by extraterrestrials. The incident is said to have occurred on January 21, 1980, around 9 a.m. in the Vierzon forest. Very quickly, the gendarmerie investigation led to a carefully constructed hoax, admitted by the witness.",
